tart=\"2889\" data-end=\"2927\">Super Stage – Sri Lanka Leg: Match 1</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2969\">\n<p data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2969\">Super Stage – Sri Lanka Leg: Match 3</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2974\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3024\">2. Pallekele International Stadium, Kandy</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3047\"><strong data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3047\">Expected Matches:</strong></p>\n<ol data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3162\">\n<li data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3079\">\n<p data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3079\">New Zealand vs West Indies</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3108\">\n<p data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3108\">Australia vs Bangladesh</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3136\">\n<p data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3136\">England vs Afghanistan</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3162\">\n<p data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3162\">Sri Lanka vs Ireland</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3167\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3231\">3. Galle International Stadium, Galle (If ICC Approves)</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3254\"><strong data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3254\">Expected Matches:</strong></p>\n<ol data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3340\">\n<li data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3280\">\n<p data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3280\">Scotland vs Zimbabwe</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3308\">\n<p data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3308\">Netherlands vs Ireland</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3340\">\n<p data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3340\">Qualifier A vs Qualifier B</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3345\">\n<p class=\"\">🏆 <strong data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3392\">Projected Knockout Schedule Overview</strong></p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\"><table data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3621\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3419\"><tr data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3419\"><th data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th><th data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Venue</th><th data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3621\"><tr data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3514\"><td data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semi-Final 1</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3475\">Ahmedabad</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3514\">High-capacity, global broadcast hub</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3567\"><td data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3530\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Semi-Final 2</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3540\">Kolkata</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3567\">Historic knockout venue</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3621\"><td data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Grand Final</td><td data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ahmedabad</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3621\">World’s largest stadium</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h1 data-start=\"7200\" data-end=\"7267\"><br></h1>\n<hr data-start=\"8161\" data-end=\"8164\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8168\" data-end=\"8207\">Why This World Cup Will Be Historic</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"8209\" data-end=\"8498\">\n<li data-start=\"8209\" data-end=\"8270\">\n<p data-start=\"8211\" data-end=\"8270\">The dual-host arrangement enhances diversity and culture.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"8271\" data-end=\"8331\">\n<p data-start=\"8273\" data-end=\"8331\">Stadiums promise modern facilities with electric crowds.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"8332\" data-end=\"8383\">\n<p data-start=\"8334\" data-end=\"8383\">T20 format guarantees fast-paced entertainment.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"8384\" data-end=\"8428\">\n<p data-start=\"8386\" data-end=\"8428\">More teams = more drama and more upsets.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"8429\" data-end=\"8498\">\n<p data-start=\"8431\" data-end=\"8498\">Mega-stadiums like Ahmedabad will create global sporting moments.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8585\">For fans, this is more than a cricket tournament—it\'s a once-in-a-decade celebration.</p><p data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8585\"><br></p><p data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8585\"><br></p>\n<hr data-start=\"8587\" data-end=\"8590\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8594\" data-end=\"8633\">FAQs –</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8639\" data-end=\"8686\">1. Has ICC officially announced the venues?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"8689\" data-end=\"8784\">Not yet. Expected venues are based on strong hosting indicators and infrastructure suitability.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"8786\" data-end=\"8789\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8795\" data-end=\"8853\">2. Which countries are hosting the 2026 T20 World Cup?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"8856\" data-end=\"8899\">India and Sri Lanka are confirmed co-hosts.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"8901\" data-end=\"8904\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8910\" data-end=\"8958\">3. When will the match schedule be released?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"8961\" data-end=\"9028\">ICC typically announces schedules 6–9 months before the tournament.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"9030\" data-end=\"9033\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9039\" data-end=\"9081\">4. Which stadium might host the final?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9084\" data-end=\"9143\">Narendra Modi Stadium, Ahmedabad, is the most likely venue.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"9145\" data-end=\"9148\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9154\" data-end=\"9200\">5. Will all matches be day-night fixtures?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9203\" data-end=\"9312\">Not all, but many games in India and Sri Lanka are expected to be under lights due to climate and viewership.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"9314\" data-end=\"9317\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9323\" data-end=\"9362\">6. How many teams will participate?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9365\" data-end=\"9432\">More teams than previous editions, as part of ICC’s expansion plan.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"9434\" data-end=\"9437\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9443\" data-end=\"9476\">7. Will tickets be expensive?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9479\" data-end=\"9548\">Prices will vary by venue and match importance, especially knockouts.</p><p></p><p><br></p>','01KA39288K9W7ZYPNEV9D5QV65.jpg','T20 World Cup 2026 Venue',NULL,18,1,'5 minutes',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2025-11-15 08:10:49','2025-11-19 09:27:09',NULL,1),
(54,'Kaynes Technology Share Price Tonigt Investment Insights','kaynes-technology-share-price-tonigt-investment-insights','<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"639\">Introduction</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"1011\">The Indian stock market has witnessed a massive rise in tech-driven companies, and <strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"745\">Kaynes Technology</strong> has quickly become one of the most talked-about names among investors. Whether you are a long-term investor, a short-term trader, or someone looking to understand this company’s potential, keeping track of the <strong data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"989\">Kaynes Technology share price</strong> has become essential.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1380\">Founded as a leading electronics manufacturing services (EMS) provider, Kaynes Technology has established a strong footprint in industrial electronics, IoT solutions, automotive components, aerospace, medical devices, and more. Its diversified portfolio and strong growth track record have made it a popular choice among investors aiming for quality mid-cap exposure.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1540\"><br></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1545\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1602\">1. About Kaynes Technology: A Rising Force in EMS</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1769\">Kaynes Technology India Ltd. is an integrated electronics manufacturer offering end-to-end design, development, and manufacturing services. Its capabilities include:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1915\">\n<li data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1787\">\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1787\">PCB assembly</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1816\">\n<p data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1816\">Embedded design services</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1838\">\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1838\">Turnkey solutions</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1867\">\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1867\">IoT-based smart products</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1915\">\n<p data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1915\">End-to-end electronics system manufacturing</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1975\">The company serves multiple high-value sectors, including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2100\">\n<li data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"1996\">\n<p data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"1996\">Automotive &amp; EV</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2020\">\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2020\">Aerospace &amp; Defense</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2033\">\n<p data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2033\">Railways</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2053\">\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2053\">Medical Devices</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2079\">\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2079\">Industrial Automation</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2100\">\n<p data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2100\">Renewable Energy</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2346\">Thanks to this diversified presence, Kaynes is not dependent on a single industry. This gives the stock a <strong data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2243\">stable long-term growth outlook</strong>, which is one reason why the <strong data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2306\">Kaynes Technology share price</strong> has attracted strong investor interest.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2351\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2428\">2. Kaynes Technology Share Price: Market Behavior &amp; Investor Interest</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2583\">The <strong data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2467\">Kaynes Technology share price</strong> has shown strong upward momentum since its market listing. A few major factors influencing the stock price include:</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2613\">a. Strong order book</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2792\">The company consistently reports a growing order pipeline, reflecting demand across sectors. A strong order book boosts investor confidence, often pushing the share price higher.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2825\">b. High-growth industry</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"3012\">India’s electronics manufacturing space is expanding rapidly. With government support for “Make in India,” companies like Kaynes benefit from rising demand and reduced import dependency.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3048\">c. Diversified client base</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3176\">Kaynes works with global and domestic players. This reduces risk and stabilizes revenue, which supports long-term stock growth.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3210\">d. Financial performance</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3335\">Consistent revenue growth, improved margins, and increasing profitability make the stock attractive for long-term investors.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3370\">e. Institutional interest</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3488\">Mutual funds, FIIs, and DIIs investing in Kaynes Technology help maintain liquidity and upward momentum in the stock.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3493\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3571\">3. Key Factors Affecting the Kaynes Technology Share Price (In Detail)</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3682\">To understand future price potential, investors must look beyond numbers. Below are the major driving forces:</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3713\">1. Industry expansion</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3816\">As India becomes a global electronics manufacturing hub, EMS companies are positioned to grow rapidly.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3853\">2. Technological innovation</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3957\">Kaynes invests heavily in automation, IoT, and advanced system design, keeping it ahead of competitors.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3995\">3. Profit margin improvement</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4101\">Higher efficiency and scale help improve margins, which often results in a positive share price movement.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4140\">4. Global supply chain trends</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4258\">Disruptions or improvements in semiconductor supply affect production cycles, indirectly influencing the stock price.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4294\">5. New client acquisitions</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4384\">Every time Kaynes announces large contracts, the share price typically reacts positively.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4389\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4463\">4. Investment Potential: Is Kaynes Technology a Good Stock to Buy?</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4612\">Investors often ask whether Kaynes Technology is a good fit for long-term or short-term investment. Here is a simplified, human-friendly breakdown:</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4652\">a. Long-Term Investment Outlook</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"4653\" data-end=\"4754\">Kaynes operates in sectors that are expected to grow exponentially in the next decade. The company’s:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4906\">\n<li data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4787\">\n<p data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4787\">consistent financial growth</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4809\">\n<p data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4809\">strong leadership</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4839\">\n<p data-start=\"4812\" data-end=\"4839\">diversified customer base</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4862\">\n<p data-start=\"4842\" data-end=\"4862\">increasing exports</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4906\">\n<p data-start=\"4865\" data-end=\"4906\">participation in high-demand industries</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"4954\">…make it a <strong data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"4953\">promising long-term investment</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"4995\">b. Short-Term Investment Outlook</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"4996\" data-end=\"5032\">Short-term traders may benefit from:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5135\">\n<li data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5058\">\n<p data-start=\"5036\" data-end=\"5058\">high trading volumes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"5059\" data-end=\"5097\">\n<p data-start=\"5061\" data-end=\"5097\">volatility during earnings seasons</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"5098\" data-end=\"5135\">\n<p data-start=\"5100\" data-end=\"5135\">news-triggered price fluctuations</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"5137\" data-end=\"5260\">Although generally stable, the <strong data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5201\">Kaynes Technology share price</strong> does see short-term movements suitable for active traders.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"5265\" data-end=\"5296\">c. Risk Factors to Consider</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5379\">Every investment carries some risks. For Kaynes Technology, the key risks include:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5523\">\n<li data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5426\">\n<p data-start=\"5383\" data-end=\"5426\">Dependence on global semiconductor supply</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5461\">\n<p data-start=\"5429\" data-end=\"5461\">High competition in EMS sector</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5483\">\n<p data-start=\"5464\" data-end=\"5483\">Market volatility</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5523\">\n<p data-start=\"5486\" data-end=\"5523\">Economic slowdowns affecting demand</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"5525\" data-end=\"5606\">However, these are mostly industry-wide factors, not company-specific weaknesses.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5611\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"5615\" data-end=\"5662\">5. Financial Strength and Growth Indicators</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"5664\" data-end=\"5776\">Investors should always analyze financial health before making a decision. Kaynes Technology stands out through:</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"5782\" data-end=\"5803\">1. Revenue Growth</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"5806\" data-end=\"5918\">The company reports strong year-on-year revenue increases, driven by rising demand in electronics manufacturing.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"5924\" data-end=\"5950\">2. EBITDA &amp; Net Profit</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"5953\" data-end=\"6035\">Improving operating margins and profitability reflect solid business fundamentals.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6041\" data-end=\"6065\">3. Low Debt Position</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6068\" data-end=\"6138\">Kaynes maintains a manageable debt ratio, making it financially sound.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6144\" data-end=\"6169\">4. Expansion Strategy</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6172\" data-end=\"6266\">New manufacturing facilities and technological upgrades are expected to support future growth.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6272\" data-end=\"6292\">5. Return Ratios</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6295\" data-end=\"6386\">ROE and ROCE figures show efficient capital management and value creation for shareholders.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"6388\" data-end=\"6391\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6395\" data-end=\"6461\">6. Why Investors Track the Kaynes Technology Share Price Daily</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"6463\" data-end=\"6533\">There are several reasons why the stock attracts consistent attention:</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6539\" data-end=\"6569\">1. Strong Brand Reputation</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6572\" data-end=\"6625\">Kaynes is a respected name in the electronics sector.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6631\" data-end=\"6670\">2. Consistent Earnings &amp; Order Wins</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6673\" data-end=\"6716\">Investors follow quarterly results closely.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6722\" data-end=\"6757\">3. Growth in EV and IoT Sectors</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6760\" data-end=\"6818\">Kaynes is positioned well in these high-potential markets.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6824\" data-end=\"6858\">4. Attractive Valuation Levels</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6861\" data-end=\"6952\">Depending on the market phase, the stock often becomes a good opportunity for accumulation.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6958\" data-end=\"6991\">5. Positive Analyst Sentiment</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"6994\" data-end=\"7054\">Brokerages generally maintain optimistic views on the stock.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"7056\" data-end=\"7059\">\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"7063\" data-end=\"7126\">7. Expert Insights: What Makes Kaynes Technology Stand Out?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"7128\" data-end=\"7179\">Industry professionals highlight several strengths:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"7181\" data-end=\"7669\">\n<li data-start=\"7181\" data-end=\"7272\">\n<p data-start=\"7183\" data-end=\"7272\"><strong data-start=\"7183\" data-end=\"7209\">End-to-End Capability:</strong> Few companies offer design-to-delivery services like Kaynes.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"7273\" data-end=\"7369\">\n<p data-start=\"7275\" data-end=\"7369\"><strong data-start=\"7275\" data-end=\"7313\">Strategic Manufacturing Locations:</strong> Plants are spread across India to optimize logistics.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"7370\" data-end=\"7467\">\n<p data-start=\"7372\" data-end=\"7467\"><strong data-start=\"7372\" data-end=\"7398\">Government Incentives:</strong> EMS companies benefit from various PLI schemes and policy support.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"7468\" data-end=\"7557\">\n<p data-start=\"7470\" data-end=\"7557\"><strong data-start=\"7470\" data-end=\"7490\">R&amp;D Investments:</strong> Advanced technological capability keeps the company competitive.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"7558\" data-end=\"7669\">\n<p data-start=\"7560\" data-end=\"7669\"><strong data-start=\"7560\" data-end=\"7585\">Client Relationships:</strong> Trusted partnerships with multinational giants create long-term income stability.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"7671\" data-end=\"7781\">For many analysts, these factors justify stable long-term confidence in the <strong data-start=\"7747\" data-end=\"7780\">Kaynes Technology share price</strong>.</p><h3 class=\"\"><b>8. What’s Behind Kaynes Technology Share Price Tonight?</b></h3><p data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2526\">Here are the major themes shaping investor sentiment around Kaynes right now:</p><p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2566\">Strong Q4 FY25 Performance</strong></p><ul data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"3110\">\n<li data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2738\">\n<p data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2738\">In Q4 FY25, Kaynes reported a <strong data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2638\">54% year-over-year jump in revenue</strong>, rising to ₹984.5 crore from about ₹637.3 crore in Q4 FY24. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.businesstoday.in/markets/stocks/story/kaynes-technology-shares-jump-9-on-strong-q4-fy25-numbers-476509-2025-05-16?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.businesstoday.in/markets/stocks/story/kaynes-technology-shares-jump-9-on-strong-q4-fy25-numbers-476509-2025-05-16?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Business Today</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2881\">\n<p data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2881\">EBITDA for that quarter surged by <strong data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2782\">76%</strong>, powering a margin of <strong data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2814\">17.1%</strong>, up from 14.9% a year ago. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.business-standard.com/amp/markets/news/kaynes-technology-share-price-climbs-9-on-strong-q4-profit-surges-43-yoy-125051600386_1.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.business-standard.com/amp/markets/news/kaynes-technology-share-price-climbs-9-on-strong-q4-profit-surges-43-yoy-125051600386_1.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Business Standard</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2977\">\n<p data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2977\">Net profit (PAT) jumped <strong data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2919\">43% YoY</strong>, to ₹116.2 crore. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.angelone.in/news//kaynes-technology-q4-fy25-earnings-results-out-share-price-surges-over-8-after-declaration?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.angelone.in/news//kaynes-technology-q4-fy25-earnings-results-out-share-price-surges-over-8-after-declaration?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Angel One</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3110\">\n<p data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3110\">For the full FY25, the PAT margin stood at <strong data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3032\">10.8%</strong>, compared to 10.2% in the prior year. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.businesstoday.in/amp/markets/stocks/story/kaynes-technology-shares-jump-9-on-strong-q4-fy25-numbers-476509-2025-05-16?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.businesstoday.in/amp/markets/stocks/story/kaynes-technology-shares-jump-9-on-strong-q4-fy25-numbers-476509-2025-05-16?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Business Today</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3207\">These results reflect robust operational leverage and a business model that is scaling rapidly.</p><p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3249\">Massive &amp; Healthy Order Book</strong></p><ul data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3784\">\n<li data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3416\">\n<p data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3416\">As of March 31, 2025, Kaynes’ order book stood at <strong data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3321\">₹6,596.9 crore</strong>, up sharply from ~₹4,115.2 crore in the previous year. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.businesstoday.in/markets/stocks/story/kaynes-technology-shares-jump-9-on-strong-q4-fy25-numbers-476509-2025-05-16?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.businesstoday.in/markets/stocks/story/kaynes-technology-shares-jump-9-on-strong-q4-fy25-numbers-476509-2025-05-16?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Business Today</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3575\">\n<p data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3575\">According to ICICI Direct analysis, this strong pipeline gives Kaynes <strong data-start=\"3489\" data-end=\"3523\">excellent visibility into FY26</strong> and beyond. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.icicidirect.com/research/equity/rapid-results/kaynes-technology-india-ltd?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.icicidirect.com/research/equity/rapid-results/kaynes-technology-india-ltd?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">ICICI Direct</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3784\">\n<p data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3784\">On top of that, the company’s announced monthly order inflows jumped: in Q4 FY25, they averaged <strong data-start=\"3674\" data-end=\"3702\">₹5,114 million per month</strong>, compared to ₹4,285 million in Q3 FY25. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://bsmedia.business-standard.com/_media/bs/data/announcements/bse/21052025/2189aa12-5b09-4c30-9c69-e58597b92840.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://bsmedia.business-standard.com/_media/bs/data/announcements/bse/21052025/2189aa12-5b09-4c30-9c69-e58597b92840.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">BS Media</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3891\">A growing order book suggests that future revenues are well-supported, which justifies bullish sentiment.</p><p class=\"\"><span data-start=\"3901\" data-end=\"3944\"><b>Margin Expansion &amp; Financial Discipline</b></span></p><ul data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4598\">\n<li data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4166\">\n<p data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"4166\">Kaynes is deliberately pushing into <strong data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4019\">higher-margin, complex segments</strong> — like aerospace electronics, smart meters, and strategic electronics — which helps boost profitability. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.business-standard.com/amp/markets/news/kaynes-technology-share-price-climbs-9-on-strong-q4-profit-surges-43-yoy-125051600386_1.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.business-standard.com/amp/markets/news/kaynes-technology-share-price-climbs-9-on-strong-q4-profit-surges-43-yoy-125051600386_1.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Business Standard</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4380\">\n<p data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4380\">According to the company’s annual report, they are exploring strategic financing options, government schemes (like PLI / ECMS), and institutional support to fund growth. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://bsmedia.business-standard.com/_media/bs/data/announcements/bse/19082025/d52aa183-1714-43c2-86fa-26c06bec250a.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://bsmedia.business-standard.com/_media/bs/data/announcements/bse/19082025/d52aa183-1714-43c2-86fa-26c06bec250a.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">BS Media</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4381\" data-end=\"4598\">\n<p data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4598\">The net working capital cycle is improving: according to ICICI Direct, net working capital days are at <strong data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4497\">87 days</strong> (as of March 2025), compared to 83 days in the prior year. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.icicidirect.com/research/equity/rapid-results/kaynes-technology-india-ltd?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.icicidirect.com/research/equity/rapid-results/kaynes-technology-india-ltd?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">ICICI Direct</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4703\">These steps give Kaynes both flexibility and strength to scale without dangerously increasing leverage.</p><p class=\"\"><span data-start=\"4713\" data-end=\"4744\"><b>Strategic Capex &amp; Expansion</b></span></p><ul data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"5289\">\n<li data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4946\">\n<p data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4946\">Kaynes is making aggressive capital expenditure (capex) — building an <strong data-start=\"4818\" data-end=\"4869\">OSAT (Outsourced Semiconductor Assembly &amp; Test)</strong> facility and an <strong data-start=\"4886\" data-end=\"4903\">HDI PCB plant</strong>. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://images.moneycontrol.com/static-mcnews/2025/01/20250130062137_Kaynes-Technology-India-29012025-prabhu.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://images.moneycontrol.com/static-mcnews/2025/01/20250130062137_Kaynes-Technology-India-29012025-prabhu.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Moneycontrol Images</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4947\" data-end=\"5123\">\n<p data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"5123\">In its QIP (Qualified Institutional Placement), the company raised <strong data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5032\">₹1,600 crore</strong>, which gives financial firepower to fuel growth. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/kaynes-technology-shares-in-focus-after-launching-rs-1600-crore-qip/articleshow/121964914.cms?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/kaynes-technology-shares-in-focus-after-launching-rs-1600-crore-qip/articleshow/121964914.cms?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">The Economic Times</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"5124\" data-end=\"5289\">\n<p data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5289\">Broader strategy: expansion into North America, more product verticals, and deeper integration with global supply chains. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://images.moneycontrol.com/static-mcnews/2025/05/20250519070606_Kaynes-Technology-India-19052025-prabhu.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://images.moneycontrol.com/static-mcnews/2025/05/20250519070606_Kaynes-Technology-India-19052025-prabhu.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Moneycontrol Images</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"5291\" data-end=\"5357\">This capex roadmap is central to Kaynes’ long-term value creation.</p><p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5396\">Valuation &amp; Analyst Views</strong></p><ul data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5821\">\n<li data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5665\">\n<p data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5665\"><strong data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5410\">Nomura</strong> sees Kaynes as a key beneficiary of rising electronics content in B2B industrial segments. They highlight Kaynes’ strong order book and expansion into OSAT, with a target price significantly above current levels. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.ndtvprofit.com/business/dixon-kaynes-get-buy-as-nomura-turns-bullish-on-indian-ems-sector?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.ndtvprofit.com/business/dixon-kaynes-get-buy-as-nomura-turns-bullish-on-indian-ems-sector?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">NDTV Profit</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"5666\" data-end=\"5821\">\n<p data-start=\"5668\" data-end=\"5821\">Meanwhile, <strong data-start=\"5679\" data-end=\"5695\">JM Financial</strong> points to strong order flows and margin expansion as key growth drivers for Kaynes. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/strong-order-flows-and-margins-to-drive-gains-for-kaynes-technology-124072901456_1.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/strong-order-flows-and-margins-to-drive-gains-for-kaynes-technology-124072901456_1.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">Business Standard</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"5823\" data-end=\"5914\">These optimistic forecasts are driving some of the bullish momentum around the share price.</p><p class=\"\">2.6 <strong data-start=\"5924\" data-end=\"5949\">Risk Factors to Watch</strong></p><p data-start=\"5951\" data-end=\"6031\">Not everything is smooth sailing, and a few risks are making investors cautious:</p><p data-start=\"7671\" data-end=\"7781\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><ol data-start=\"6033\" data-end=\"6679\">\n<li data-start=\"6033\" data-end=\"6206\">\n<p data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6206\"><strong data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6052\">Guidance Cut</strong>: The company cut its FY25 revenue guidance from ₹3,000 crore to ₹2,800 crore, citing delays in order execution. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/kaynes-technology-shares-slumps-19-after-management-slashes-fy25-revenue-guidance-post-q3-results/articleshow/117616890.cms?from=mdr&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/kaynes-technology-shares-slumps-19-after-management-slashes-fy25-revenue-guidance-post-q3-results/articleshow/117616890.cms?from=mdr&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">The Economic Times</span><span class=\"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]\">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"6207\" data-end=\"6318\">\n<p data-start=\"6210\" data-end=\"6318\"><strong data-start=\"6210\" data-end=\"6234\">Working Capital Risk</strong>: Even though cycle is improving, EMS businesses are inherently capital-intensive.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"6319\" data-end=\"6438\">\n<p data-start=\"6322\" data-end=\"6438\"><strong data-start=\"6322\" data-end=\"6349\">Execution Risk on Capex</strong>: Big projects like OSAT or PCB could face delays, regulatory issues, or cost overruns.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"6439\" data-end=\"6562\">\n<p data-start=\"6442\" data-end=\"6562\"><strong data-start=\"6442\" data-end=\"6463\">Global Macro Risk</strong>: Supply chain shocks, semiconductor cycle downturns, or geopolitical issues could impact growth.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"6563\" data-end=\"6679\">\n<p data-start=\"6566\" data-end=\"6679\"><strong data-start=\"6566\" data-end=\"6584\">Valuation Risk</strong>: High growth potential is already priced in; any earnings miss could lead to a sharp rerating.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr data-start=\"7783\" data-end=\"7786\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"7790\" data-end=\"7864\">9. Final Thoughts</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"7866\" data-end=\"8084\">Kaynes Technology represents a new generation of Indian manufacturing excellence. Its strong growth, financial stability, technological innovation, and strategic sector presence make the company an attractive pick for:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"8086\" data-end=\"8235\">\n<li data-start=\"8086\" data-end=\"8129\">\n<p data-start=\"8088\" data-end=\"8129\">Long-term investors seeking compounding</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"8130\" data-end=\"8179\">\n<p data-start=\"8132\" data-end=\"8179\">Medium-term investors targeting steady growth</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"8180\" data-end=\"8235\">\n<p data-start=\"8182\" data-end=\"8235\">Short-term traders benefiting from market movements</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"8237\" data-end=\"8384\">While investors must consider risks and monitor quarterly results, the overall outlook for the <strong data-start=\"8332\" data-end=\"8365\">Kaynes Technology share price</strong> remains promising.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"8386\" data-end=\"8389\">\n<h3 class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8393\" data-end=\"8430\">(FAQs)</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8436\" data-end=\"8491\">1. What is the Kaynes Technology share price today?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"8494\" data-end=\"8590\">The share price changes during market hours. Investors should check real-time charts on NSE/BSE.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8596\" data-end=\"8662\">2. Is Kaynes Technology a good stock for long-term investment?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"8665\" data-end=\"8761\">Yes, the company has strong financials, a diversified business model, and high growth potential.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8767\" data-end=\"8826\">3. Why is the Kaynes Technology share price increasing?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"8829\" data-end=\"8920\">Factors include strong earnings, order wins, expansion plans, and positive industry trends.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8926\" data-end=\"8981\">4. Does Kaynes Technology have a high-risk profile?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"8984\" data-end=\"9073\">It carries industry-wide risks but remains fundamentally stable, making it moderate-risk.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9079\" data-end=\"9134\">5. Which sectors drive Kaynes Technology’s revenue?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9137\" data-end=\"9220\">Automotive, industrial, aerospace, medical, IoT solutions, and railway electronics.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9226\" data-end=\"9280\">6. Can short-term traders benefit from this stock?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9283\" data-end=\"9344\">Yes, due to consistent volume and news-driven price movement.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9350\" data-end=\"9383\">7. Does Kaynes pay dividends?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9386\" data-end=\"9465\">The company’s dividend policy depends on profitability and strategic expansion.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"9471\" data-end=\"9534\">8. What affects the Kaynes Technology share price the most?</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"9537\" data-end=\"9619\">Quarterly earnings, industry demand, global supply chains, and order book updates.</p>','01KA3D8ZXCPT1PTEG3R7ZXK6FA.jpg','Kaynes Technology Share Price ',NULL,3,1,'7 minutes',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2025-11-15 09:24:24','2025-11-19 09:21:52',NULL,1),
(55,'Vanessa Villanueva: Life Story, Personal Journey, Career, and Untold Facts','vanessa-villanueva','<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-53e2be90-7fff-dba3-feab-383231f14e44\"><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Introduction</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Vanessa Villanueva is a name that often draws curiosity due to her connection with a well-known figure in the music industry. However, limiting her identity to that association alone would be unfair. Vanessa Villanueva represents strength, privacy, dignity, and independence—qualities that resonate with many people today. Despite being connected to fame, she chose a life away from the spotlight, focusing on family, self-respect, and personal growth.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">This biography explores the life of Vanessa Villanueva in depth, covering her early life, personal background, marriage, motherhood, lifestyle, and why she continues to remain relevant in public interest.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Early Life and Background of Vanessa Villanueva</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Vanessa Villanueva was born in the United States and raised in a relatively private and grounded environment. From a young age, she displayed a calm and reserved personality. Unlike many individuals who later become associated with public figures, Vanessa never actively sought attention or fame.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Her upbringing emphasized family values, emotional strength, and independence. These principles later played a crucial role in shaping her responses to life’s challenges. Vanessa’s early life remained largely out of the public eye, which aligns with the way she continues to live today.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Education and Personal Growth</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">While specific details about Vanessa Villanueva’s education are not publicly documented, it is evident that she values self-awareness and real-life learning. Her decisions throughout life reflect emotional intelligence, maturity, and clarity.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Rather than relying on publicity or external validation, Vanessa focused on inner growth and stability. This mindset helped her navigate both personal happiness and difficult transitions with grace.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Marriage and Relationship Journey</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Vanessa Villanueva became more widely known after marrying renowned guitarist Chris Perez. Chris Perez gained international recognition as a former member of the band associated with legendary singer Selena Quintanilla.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Marriage with Chris Perez</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Vanessa Villanueva and Chris Perez got married in 2001. Their relationship was built on mutual respect and affection. After marriage, they focused on building a family-oriented life away from constant media attention.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">The couple was blessed with two children, and for several years, they shared a stable family life.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Divorce and Life After Separation</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">In 2008, Vanessa Villanueva and Chris Perez decided to separate. Unlike many celebrity divorces filled with controversy, their separation remained respectful and low-profile.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Vanessa never used media platforms to create narratives or attract sympathy. Instead, she chose privacy and emotional balance, which earned her quiet admiration from many observers.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant