(62,'Messi vs Ronaldo: All About the Two Football Icons’ Career Records','messi-vs-ronaldo','<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\" class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Introduction </span></b></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://wordlenyt.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">LionelMessi vs Cristiano Ronaldo</a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"> is the most covered aspect in the history of\nfootball. For almost 20 years, they ruled the world of football with their\nregularity, high numbers and enduring influence at club and international\nlevel. Well, here you can have them be hopeful and inspired during their entire\ncareer in concise format.<br><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\" class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Early Career: How Their Journeys Began</span></b></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:3\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Lionel Messi – <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lionel_Messi\" target=\"_blank\">Messi</a> was\nborn in Argentina’s second city, Rosario, and began his footballing education\nat Newell’s Old Boys. When he was 11, he was diagnosed with growth hormone\ndeficiency. His family did not have the means to pay for him to get treatment,\na setback that could have derailed his football career. FC Barcelona provided\nmedical assistance and a home at La Masia, which prompted them to move Spain.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">At La Masia,\nMessi learned to play in a team philosophy based on ball movement and technical\nfootball. Technical quality, quick reaction and balance compensated for his\ninferior physique. Okonkwo’s rise through youth ranks was more steady and not\nso much meteoric, predicated on consistency more than physical dominance.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:3\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Cristiano Ronaldo – <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cristiano_Ronaldo\" target=\"_blank\">Ronaldo </a>was\nborn on the Portuguese island of Madeira and started his football education in\na locale that took him to Sporting CP’s academy in Lisbon. Living away from home\nearly in life necessitated emotional maturity. In his youth he did not exhibit\nsophisticated technique, but rather speed, strength and a competitive attitude.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">His chance\ncame during a friendly game against Manchester United, as his display in the same\nshaped this eventual deal. This was the moment I went from being a domestic\ntalent to an international pro.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\" class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Career Rise and Peak Years</span></b></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:3\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Messi’s Rise and Peak Years<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Messi came\nthrough the ranks at Barcelona and matured into the focal point of its team.\nHis ascent was married to the tactical philosophy of Barcelona. Eventually he\nmoved from a winger to an out-and-out attacking skipper.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">In his\nprime, Messi combined regularly strong goal totals with well charted assists\nlead. He affected games beyond the scoreboard, dictating tempo and connecting\nmidfield to attack. In clubs he won numerous league titles and the Champions\nLeague. On the international scene, despite his consistent performances he fell\nshort of big trophies at first and that did inform much of his career’s public\ndiscussion.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:3\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Ronaldo’s Rise and Peak Years<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Ronaldo’s\nascent was expedited at Manchester United, where he learned the tactical\ndiscipline and enhanced end product that define his game. At Real Madrid he\nturned himself into a reliable scorer of goals.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">The towering\nyears of Ronaldo were defined by incredible goal scoring, especially in\nChampions League knockout games. He was a force in terms of physique, aerial\npresence and cutting edge. International success soon came when he led Portugal\nto European Championship victory, adding weight to his credentials as a leader.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:1\" class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Comparison At a Glance</span></b></h2>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"504\" style=\"width: 377.8pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:25.65pt\">\n   <td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 25.65pt;\">\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\n   text-align:center;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\n   font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\n   mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Category<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 25.65pt;\">\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\n   text-align:center;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\n   font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\n   mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Messi<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n   </td>\n   <td width=\"185\" style=\"width: 138.95pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; border-image: initial; padding: 0.75pt; height: 25.65pt;\">\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\n   text-align:center;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\n   font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\