p;\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Vision and intelligence<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<h3 data-start=\"4535\" data-end=\"4546\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Ronaldo<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\ntab-stops:list .5in\" data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4568\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Powerful shooting<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\ntab-stops:list .5in\" data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4589\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Aerial dominance<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\ntab-stops:list .5in\" data-start=\"4592\" data-end=\"4612\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Speed and strength<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\ntab-stops:list .5in\" data-start=\"4615\" data-end=\"4634\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]-->Physical presence<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<p data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4690\">Both styles changed modern football in\ndifferent ways.<o:p></o:p></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"\"><b>Late Career Phase: Adaptation and Longevity</b><o:p></o:p></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Messi’s Late\nCareer<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Later on in\nhis career, Messi changed his style of play to become less reliant on speed and\nmore focused on position, vision and playmaking. His influence then became one\nof leadership and efficiency. That stage brought long-awaited international\nacclaim with Argentina, validating his capacity to lead at the very top.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Ronaldo’s\nLate Career<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Ronaldo\nremained at the top performance level through physical discipline. He was less\ninvolved in build up play but still had his potency in front of goal. In his\ntwilight years, that latter stage of his career reveals planning and\nprofessionalism over simply relying on his speed.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><b>Upcoming Future Plans</b></span></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><b>Messi –\nWhat’s Next?<o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-margin-top-a