; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]--> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"> Heavy exposure to youth football in\nArgentina<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Ronaldo –\nWhat’s Next?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\nauto;margin-left:1.25in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal;\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]--> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"> Short term emphasis on prolonging\nplaying career<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\nauto;margin-left:1.25in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal;\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">The\npossibility of playing again in a league or one last international</span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">tournament<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\nauto;margin-left:1.25in;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-.25in;line-height:normal;\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</span></span><!--[endif]--> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"> Future ambitions are to own a club,\ncoach or be involved in the business side of football<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nmargin-left:.25in;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nBN-BD\">Both players will stay connected to</span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">the game\nlong into retirement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"\"><b>Conclusion</b><o:p></o:p></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\" data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5641\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">The Messi-Ronaldo debate is a tale of two routes to\nfootballing greatness. Messi’s career deftness recalls football intelligence\nand system-fed development; Ronaldo’s trajectory ambition, adaptability and physical\nsuperiority. They coexisted to raise the level of modern football and define an era.\nTheir big fan base and public image have made them a golden period in the\nuniverse. They are the king of football for their fans. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><b>FAQ</b></span></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q1. Who\nscored more goals overall?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nBN-BD\"><br>\nA: Cristiano Ronaldo has scored more total career goals.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q2. Who has\nmore assists in professional football?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><br>\nA: Lionel Messi has more assists.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q3. Who won\nmore Ballon d’Or awards?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nBN-BD\"><br>\nA: Messi has won more Ballon d’Or titles.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q4. Who has\nmore major trophies?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><br>\nA: Messi has won more total major trophies.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q5. Who\nperformed better in international tournaments?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><br>\nA: Both succeeded—Messi won the World Cup, Ronaldo won the European\nChampionship.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q6. Who is\nconsidered the better playmaker?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><br>\nA: Messi is considered the better playmaker.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q7. Who is\nmore physically dominant?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nBN-BD\"><br>\nA: Ronaldo is more physically dominant.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q8. Who\nadapted better in late career?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><br>\nA: Both adapted differently—Messi focused on playmaking, Ronaldo on finishing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q9. Are\nMessi and Ronaldo still active players?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><br>\nA: Yes, both are still active.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Q10. Will\nMessi and Ronaldo play in the 2026 FIFA World Cup?</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"><br>\nA: There is no official confirmation yet, but neither has ruled it out.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>','01KEPW2XG5604RWJCZRP9B7YH4.jpg','Messi vs Ronaldo',NULL,18,1,'5 minutes',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2026-01-11 15:51:35','2026-01-11 18:15:03',NULL,1),
(63,'Messi Jersey Argentina & Club Collection-Price, Number and History','messi-jersey','<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Introduction:</span></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">The </span><a href=\"https://wordlenyt.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Messi jersey</a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\"> is more than football clothing. It represents moments, emotions,\nvictories, heartbreaks, and history written on the pitch. For fans around the\nworld, wearing the jersey feels personal—like carrying a piece of football\ngreatness. From dusty streets in Argentina to packed stadiums across Europe and\nthe United States, this jersey has become one of the most recognized and\ndesired shirts in sports culture.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">This article\ncovers everything about the Lionel jersey—Argentina and club collections, jersey\nnumbers, World Cup history, prices, and why each version matters. Here, some\nfocused and hidden history will be reveal out about it. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">The Man Behind the Jersey:</span></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/leomessi/\" target=\"_blank\">Lionel Messi</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">is widely regarded as one of football’s greatest players. His influence is so\nstrong that the shirt he wears instantly becomes one of the most demanded\njerseys in the world. Unlike many stars, his jerseys gained value not from\nmarketing hype, but from performances, loyalty, and unforgettable moments.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Jersey Numbers and What Represent:</span></h2>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:3\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Number 30 – Youth and Promise<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l29 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">First senior Barcelona jersey<o:p></o:p></span></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l29 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Represents the beginning of his\n     professional career<o:p></o:p></span></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l29 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Rare and highly collectible<o:p></o:p></span></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l29 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Simple design, minimal branding<o:p></o:p></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:3\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Number 19 – Development Phase<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-language:BN-BD\">Worn during his rise to stardom<o:p></o:p></span></li>\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-