han Just “Mark Wahlberg Wife”</strong></h2><p>While many search for <strong>mark wahlberg wife</strong>, Rhea Durham is much more than a celebrity spouse. She is a former model, devoted mother, and supportive partner who has helped shape Mark Wahlberg’s personal and professional growth.</p><p>Their marriage represents stability, shared values, and commitment. From raising four children to balancing Hollywood fame, their relationship shows that long-term love is possible—even in the spotlight.</p><p>Mark Wahlberg height, fitness dedication, business success, and acting achievements may capture headlines, but behind his accomplishments stands a strong and steady partner.</p><p>In the end, their story isn’t just about fame—it’s about faith, family, and a lasting partnership built on respect and love.</p><h2><strong>FAQ: Mark Wahlberg Wife</strong></h2><h3><strong>1. Who is Mark Wahlberg’s wife?</strong></h3><p>Mark Wahlberg’s wife is Rhea Durham, an American model known for her work in major fashion magazines during the late 1990s and early 2000s.</p><h3><strong>2. When did Mark Wahlberg get married?</strong></h3><p>Mark Wahlberg married Rhea Durham on August 1, 2009, in a private Catholic ceremony in Beverly Hills, California.</p><h3><strong>3. How did Mark Wahlberg and Rhea Durham meet?</strong></h3><p>Mark Wahlberg and Rhea Durham met in 2001 in New York City. They dated for several years before deciding to get married.</p><h3><strong>4. How many children do Mark Wahlberg and his wife have?</strong></h3><p>Mark Wahlberg and Rhea Durham have four children: Ella Rae, Michael, Brendan, and Grace Margaret.</p><h3><strong>5. What does Mark Wahlberg’s wife do for a living?</strong></h3><p>Rhea Durham is a professional model. She appeared in several well-known fashion magazines and advertising campaigns before focusing more on family life.</p><h3><strong>6. What is Mark Wahlberg height?</strong></h3><p>Mark Wahlberg height is approximately 5 feet 8 inches (173 cm).</p><h3>